    },
    {
        "text": "What exactly is a knight competition?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Szewczyk, what do you think?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_103",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Forget the song and dance, Czarny, I'm busy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Out with it. What are you up to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_103",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm very sorry to say... the Roar Knightclub has decided to switch you out of pole position in their starting lineup for the Major. Their new safeguard knight ranks highly just as you do, and his Arts should be useful to the team.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_103",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "This... is nothing like what we agreed...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_103",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, your down payment will still clear. But the rates for a knightclub's reserve are an invariably different question. You understand this, correct?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, now... don't make any hasty moves. Your child is celebrating a tenth birthday soon, I hear. You needn't lose your job now over assaulting someone as insignificant as myself...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Roar Knightclub will still be paying you plenty. You needn't make any efforts for at least the rest of the year.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_103",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I need the lineup corrected, for God's sakes! I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_103",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That'll be up to your own performance, Szewczyk. There's always a way to live on, is there not?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_103",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You're not wrong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "You could've just sent out any old envoy to tell me this. Why'd you need to meet me personally? Are all spokespeople this bored for something to do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_103",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... don't misunderstand me. I didn't come out here specifically for you. I was only here to make sure of some event arrangements.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems we've been a little lax in parts. Our divisions have each encountered very minor bumps in the road, which some offenders are seeing fit to take advantage of.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_103",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Are you threatening me? Threatening 'Plastic' Knight Szewczyk to take on your dirty work?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_103",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing of the sort.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_103",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then what are you trying to do here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_103",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right now, I have two particular knights who are currently working to enter the arena... but, unfortunately, they clearly do not have the points to do so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_103",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Pfah... If you want a knight to make it in, you have your ways...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_106",
        "name2": "avg_npc_103",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't put it like that. There are times one must respect the rules, and keep some conduct undisclosed\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Making use of the law versus violating it is a night and day affair, after all. The fundamental difference lies in whether the parties involved possess the capacity to do so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just give it one nod of assent, and we'll add an event for the transfer of points, along with all its formalities. Of course, in much the same manner, I can settle of some of your complications with the Roar Knightclub...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "text": "How would you feel about that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Spokesman Czarny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
