    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014OUT! The Strider Knight's sole-mount accelerator devices are non-functional! That sudden brake knocks him off right before the finish\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "ACROSS THE LINE\u2014! The winner, from Gloryfall Knightclub, is the Wisteria Knight! And right behind, Maria Nearl\u2014hounding that medal!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "With his accelerators out, the Strider Knight has fallen all the way from second place to seventh\u2014! It's not a good day to be the Strider!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "It just goes to show how crucial a knight's equipment is!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "And Ellen Select Technologies, who provide intimate maintenance, repair and upgrades to your equipment with their comprehensive member plans, have provided a no-expense-spared package for our knights!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew... runner-up, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "(This way... I'm another step closer to the Major...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Auntie Zofia...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_sportsbar",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, there's an unexpected customer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, sit wherever you'd like.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Marcin... it's really you? That tremendous knight of days gone by runs this little bar now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They stripped old Marcin of his knighthood long ago. Now all he does is eat up his savings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "text": "How'd 'Plastic' Szewczyk find his way to this little place? Tell you the truth, this bar doesn't see all that many active knights in it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're tremendous past, Maria's tremendous present. They carried a story about your bar on the entertainment news last night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph... tremendous all around. I'll have a 'Red Edelweiss.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This one's on me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "My pleasure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Roar Guards' training camp's a long way away. I won't let you waste the trip.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, you've come to enemy headquarters to spy on us, then? Right that old newspaper-worthy wrong for the Majors?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm not going to be in the Majors.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh... Roar Guards' decision? Thought you and your sponsors were on pretty good personal terms?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha. Personal terms. Managing a relationship with a corp is like dating a Catastrophe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "As always, the decision came from the next floor up...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Knights Association?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Worse than that... try the General Chamber of Commerce.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hum.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I know what you want to say, Marcin. Up there, you're thinking, 'how's a tiny little Plastic Knight get into such a big mess?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still know my limits, and nobody goes this overkill on a knight who knows how to follow plans, so their problem is elsewhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "A rumor's spreading door-to-door. People saying the Radiant Knight was never even Infected, that her exile from Kazimierz was more complicated than that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Like hell I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Put your guard down... I'm not probing you here, Marcin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just want Czarny to learn there's a price to pay for pissing about with nobles... and I'm assuming he's got one eye on Maria Nearl too, doesn't he?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...The knights are joining hands and protesting the Association? This sort of thing won't ever end well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just trying not to be ridden roughshod.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks for the drink... Marcin, one last word... when I was young, it was watching your matches that made me finally decide to become a knight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Went the wrong way back then, looks like.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No. I'm ready to go my own way now, aren't I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "See you next time, old Marcin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Szewczyk, my own last word... stay safe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_103",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hmph. No knight ever needed to bow to the peddlers. Roar Knightclub'll see things my way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Plastic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
