    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, you've been tailing us for ages now. Time you showed your face, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flametail' Sona"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, the overbearing type... No, I do NOT like fans like you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flametail' Sona"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "'Wait\u2014that bow\u2014are you\u2014?!'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flametail' Sona"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Thought I'd say that and keel over, Armorless Union assassin?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flametail' Sona"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm... so this is how you're molded. Way you dodge about everywhere, no-one's actually seen your looks before. Real gloomy line of work you're in...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flametail' Sona"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't get the chance everyday\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flametail' Sona"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_123",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hey.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ashlock Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_123",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014to have a real scrap, you and us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flametail' Sona"
    },
