    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah\u2014auntie\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... uncle...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I look away from you for a second, and you somehow dig yourself even deeper.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And when are you planning to stop?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "The leadership has been asking me time and time again about you. Every day I work in the Publicity Department is spent sorting out the trouble you cause... Half of my hours at work are lost to waiting for direction from the leadership.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go to the Knights Association this moment and exit the tournament. You don't have the faintest idea what you're doing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that what you wanted to say...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You will not kill yourself over this, Maria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are a child of the Nearl family. You ought to know restraint.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "These annoyances all lie low in the face of the Major, so this is up to you to do, but you've already earned yourself plenty of attention.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Abandon the idea that you can force your way into the Major. Abandon, also, any idea that you've yet faced the strongest competition knights.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But I don't want to just sit and watch while the Nearl family's nobility gets stripped\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Vainglory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I've made it clear before that the Nearls do not need the approval of the Knights Association, obscene as it now is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you somehow come to believe that without their recognition, our ancestors' deeds would cease to exist? Nonsense! For all these years, the Nearl family stood alone to defend our name!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "What one cannot do, one must abandon. When one does not know how to give up... that blind alley is their end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Uncle...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Margaret has influenced you too much, Maria. She could never recognize her own ignorance, and you are not to blindly follow her example.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't give me that look. Have I said anything wrong? And surmounting the rulesetters within their own rules? Lunatic ravings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know Margaret's temper. What she ultimately despised was the commercialization of the competition knights. I thought she had some backbone...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what happened? Back against the wall, she still chose the path of competition, to flaunt her 'convictions.' Yes, indeed. 'Convictions.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "And could she change anything?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Uncle... don't talk about Margaret like this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She could not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "The one thing she changed was how the corporations treated the Nearl family! The one thing she accomplished was forcing my father, bedridden as he was, to clean up her mess!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "'The Radiant Knight' is a title she should've never been conferred! She has no power to shoulder any glory of the sort!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Uncle!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So what about you...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aren't you... working for the corporations, even now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "You forbid me from competing while you go play servant boy to the corporations and watch the Nearl family's knighthood slip away? You can stomach that?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're still young. For that, I won't blame your ignorance... but you should show respect to your elders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This again...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The skyscrapers... that the people of Kazimierz built, generation upon generation, cast the shadows that hide you in your hometown, shielded by your elders. What could you see from this safety?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you truly believe you had something? As nothing more than a young, fledgling knight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "When the sun dawned over the frontier fortresses, the Ursus skyscrapers drew their line in the clouds on the horizon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "The tower attendants recreated the motions of battle in the arena to please their nobles. The young steam knights donned the armor of old to temper and hone their skills.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bounty hunters and robbers razed one destitute village after another, while the great cities were absorbed in hopes of building ever more arenas. One could call the harvest of a village versus the tax it pays comical.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But all of that paled to the last sigh my father uttered on his deathbed. Not for Margaret, not for your parents\u2014it was his lament given to all of Kazimierz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "How could you not disappoint me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right, Maria, you're right. I am good for nothing, nothing more than a corporate, captive burdenbeast.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "So. What about you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$phonevibration",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 3,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Director? No, just a quick personal matter to tend to... No, of course work takes priority over personal...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "The project meeting? Today? No, I didn't forget... Apologies, my greatest apologies, I'm very sorry, you're right...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be back there momentarily... What? No, he doesn't understand the scope of the project... Yes, I'm sorry...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then if... If he could present in my stead... Yes, my apologies... The manager's responsibility? I... Yes, this will be the last time. No, there won't be a next time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "You may terminate me if this happens again. Yes, of course, I promise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am truly deeply sorry, Director.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I do not have much time to waste, Maria. Give me an answer, now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You won't change my mind, Uncle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're just like Margaret... you disgust me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your parents would find no pride in you. Take some time to calm down. Start thinking hard about who you really are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Please, just stop talking!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_108#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ignorant of the world and its untold ways... Pray for blessings. That is all you have left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "M\u0142ynar"
    },
